msgid "Recommended defaults: YandexBot (verify rDNS), Googlebot (verify rDNS), YandexDirect/Google AdWords verifiers, webmasters tools. SEO analytics bots (Ahrefs, Semrush, MJ12) can be exempted without rDNS verification or blocked together with everything else."
